id: mutant-core-fourth-effect
name: Mutant Core: Consume
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: mutant-core
fromEffect: 4
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Mutant Core's fourth effect, as a Maneuver: an Integrated Item destroyed for the Power Up or a Surge, out of sequence - three times an Encounter.
text: >
  (4)-[1/Round, 3/Encounter]: As an Instant Maneuver, you may destroy one of your Integrated Items to either use the Power Up Maneuver or use a Surge of your choice as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

# Which Item, and the Power Up or a Surge, asked; destroyed once it is used (chat.mjs mutantConsume).
[on used]
mutantConsume();
